{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Miss Monochrome - The Animation","\"Miss Monochrome\" is an original character design from seiyuu Horie Yui. In March 2012, she first used the \"Miss Monochrome\" character as a 3D virtual singer to sing her songs at her concert \"Horie Yui wo Meguru Bouken III ~Secret Mission Tour~\". Later, the character appeared in a range of merchandise as well as in the social network game \"Girlfriend (Beta)\".\n\n\r\nAccording to the setting, Miss Monochrome loves only the monochrome style, dislikes all kinds of color, and always dreams about changing the world into her favorite monochrome color."],"ja":["ミス・モノクローム -The Animation-",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":30384,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-20033","ids":{"shikimori":20033,"mal":20033,"anilist":20033,"kodik":"serial-40740"},"kodikIds":["serial-22107","serial-6593","serial-40740"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-22107":"2020-01-31T17:08:43Z","serial-6593":"2019-12-01T10:58:36Z","serial-40740":"2022-02-11T10:35:08Z"},"title":"Мисс Монохром","originalTitle":"Miss Monochrome The Animation","alt":"Мисс Монохром ТВ-1 Miss Monochrome - The Animation ミス・モノクローム -The Animation-","description":"Она одевается только в черно-белое, дружит с пылесосом и мечтает стать самой популярной певицей и идолом! Знакомьтесь! Мисс Монохром — оригинальный персонаж, созданный сэйю Юи Хориэ , впервые появившийся в 2012 году в качестве виртуального исполнителя её песен для концертного тура. Позднее няшка Монохром появлялась в ряде рекламных акций, а также компьютерной игре «Girlfirend».","year":2013,"type":"TV","genres":["Комедия","идолы жен","Музыка"],"rating":6.38,"popularity":13245,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[30384],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/20033/e927794e4addced5f4094e9d74b71c78.jpeg","width":317,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20033-YGHBbXv0fdWn.png","width":1900,"height":693}},"rele